# Chicken Noodle Soup

Based on [Chrissy Teigen Cravings](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251202235345/https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/)), pg. 44

{ rating="3" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 Tbsp extra [virgin olive oil]{ ing="virgin-olive-oil" }
- [ ] 1 medium [onion]{ ing="onion" }, chopped
- [ ] 5 medium [carrots]{ ing="carrots" }, coined
- [ ] 6 [celery stalks]{ ing="celery-stalks" }, cut into half moons
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 1 tsp [thyme]{ ing="thyme" }, chopped
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [pepper]{ ing="pepper" }
- [ ] 1 [bay leaf]{ ing="bay-leaf" },
- [ ] 10 cups [chicken broth]{ ing="chicken-broth" }
- [ ] 3 ounces [wide egg noodles]{ ing="wide-egg-noodles" }, cooked
- [ ] [rotisserie chicken meat]{ ing="rotisserie-chicken-meat" }, shredded

## Recipe

1. In a big pot, heat [oil]{ ing="virgin-olive-oil" } over medium-high heat. Add the [onion]{ ing="onion" }; stir and cook until softened (6-8 min)
1. Add the [carrots]{ ing="carrots" }, celery, [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, [thyme]{ ing="thyme" }, [salt]{ ing="salt" }, and [pepper]{ ing="pepper" } until the carrots soften (~5 minutes)
1. Add the [bay leaf]{ ing="bay-leaf" } and [chicken broth]{ ing="chicken-broth" }. Boil and reduce heat to simmer for 45 minutes
1. Shred the chicken and cook the [noodles]{ ing="wide-egg-noodles" }
1. At 45 minutes, stir in the chicken and cooked [noodles]{ ing="wide-egg-noodles" }. Heat for 5-10 min then toss the [bay leaf]{ ing="bay-leaf" } and serve
